msgid "This translation was previously created in the WordPress editor. When you switch to the Translation Dashboard, the structure of the translated post will be updated to match the original, but WPML will use your existing translation as a base so the tone and terminology are preserved."
msgstr ""

msgid "This translation was previously created in the WordPress editor. When you switch to WPML Translation Editor, the structure of the translated post will be updated to match the original, but WPML will use your existing translation as a base so the tone and terminology are preserved."
msgstr ""

